aegis-rs (Aegis compatible OTP generator for the CLI)

aegis-rs generates one-time passwords from backup vaults exported by the
Android app Aegis Authenticator. It supports encrypted vaults, fuzzy
selection, clipboard copying, and JSON output.

Run aegis-rs with the path to an exported vault:

  aegis-rs /path/to/aegis-backup.json

rust-opt is required at build time only. The build uses the crate
archives listed in aegis-rs.info and does not access the network.

Homepage: https://github.com/Granddave/aegis-rs
